# Chart styling

Follow the RenMac house style in
@C:/Users/asingh/new_work/econ-templates/charts/renmac_chart_style.py

Mandatory:

- Use the color constants (C_PRIMARY, C_SECONDARY, C_BLACK, C_NAVY).
- Apply renmac_style(ax, title, subtitle) on every chart.
- Title ≤11 words, sentence case, no colon.
- Save to outputs/figures/ as PNG at dpi=200, bbox_inches="tight".
- Save the underlying data alongside the PNG as Parquet + CSV.
